[{"text": "President of the Republic of", "start": 0.24, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": ">> Kotivvoir.", "start": 1.28, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": ">> The General Assembly will now hear a", "start": 6.64, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "statement by his excellency Kashim", "start": 9.44, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Shettima, vice president of the Federal", "start": 11.28, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "Republic of Nigeria.", "start": 14.4, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his", "start": 17.199, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 19.68, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 22.32, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 61.28, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "the Secretary General of the UN, the", "start": 63.28, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "Deputy Secretary General, Excellencies H", "start": 66.96, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "of State and Government, distinguished", "start": 70.159, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "delegates,", "start": 72.56, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 74.159, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "I extend my warmest congratulations to", "start": 76.88, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "you, Mr. President.", "start": 79.04, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "on behalf of President Bola Ahmed Tinibu", "start": 81.119, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "on your election as president of the 8th", "start": 84.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "session of the United Nations General", "start": 87.759, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "Assembly and assure you of Nigeria's", "start": 89.68, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "full cooperation and support. I commend", "start": 92.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "your predecessors stewardship of this", "start": 95.2, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "assembly. I also salute the secretary", "start": 97.2, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "general, his excellency Antonio Gutares", "start": 100.079, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "and the deputy secretary general amina", "start": 103.36, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Muhammad for sharing the United Nations", "start": 106.32, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "through storms that have sharpened our", "start": 108.96, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "awareness of the course of inaction.", "start": 111.439, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "None of us can pretend that conflicts", "start": 114.32, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "within our borders or in lands far", "start": 116.88, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "beyond them do not exact a price from", "start": 118.56, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "us. Such is the reach of our", "start": 121.119, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "interdependence.", "start": 123.119, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "Such is the agency of this session", "start": 125.04, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "sacred duty to restore trust in the", "start": 126.799, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "international institutions we establish", "start": 129.36, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "to reconcile our differences and advance", "start": 131.92, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "our common interests.", "start": 134.64, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "The persistence of conflicts across the", "start": 137.12, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "world recall the purpose for which the", "start": 139.36, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "United Nations was founded", "start": 140.879, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "to sphere succeeding generations the", "start": 143.52, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "devastation of war. We must therefore", "start": 146.08, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "return to the founding principles of", "start": 148.879, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "dialogue, mutual respect and collective", "start": 150.72, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "responsibility.", "start": 153.2, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "Nigeria stands by the charter and its", "start": 154.8, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "promise of a wall and where diplomacy", "start": 156.959, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "prevails over coion, cooperation over", "start": 159.2, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "isolation, an international law over", "start": 162.16, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "arbitrary exercise of power.", "start": 164.879, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "Mr. President, the reform of this", "start": 168.08, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "institution must begin with the", "start": 170.8, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "reconstitution of the security council", "start": 173.12, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "for the wall of 2026", "start": 175.599, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "cannot remain captive to the", "start": 178.08, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "distribution of power in 1945.", "start": 179.519, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "Africa cannot continue to fill the", "start": 183.04, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "council's agenda while remaining absent", "start": 185.84, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "from its permanent membership.", "start": 187.76, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Nigeria demands in accordance with the", "start": 190.159, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "Delwini consensus and the safety", "start": 193.28, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "declaration", "start": 195.28, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "at least two permanencies for Africa", "start": 196.959, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "with all the rights and responsibilities", "start": 199.92, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "of permanent membership including the", "start": 201.599, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "bet for as long as it exists and five", "start": 203.76, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "non-permanencies in total", "start": 207.04, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "the authority to speak for humanity", "start": 209.92, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "carries an obligation to represent it", "start": 212.959, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "Nigeria stands ready to assume greater", "start": 216.4, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "responsibility", "start": 219.2, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "on the strength of obligations honored", "start": 220.56, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "and sacrifices made over decades in the", "start": 222.4, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "service of peace. From Liberia and", "start": 224.959, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "Sierra Leon to Darpool, Mali and the", "start": 227.76, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "Gambia, we have committed personnel", "start": 231.92, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "resources when international solidarity", "start": 234.239, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "required action. Through Echoas, the", "start": 236.64, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "African Union and our G of Guinea", "start": 239.76, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "partnerships, we continue to advance", "start": 241.68, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "mediation, democratic governance,", "start": 243.84, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "counterterrorism and maritime security.", "start": 246.319, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "Mr. President, our poring policy rest on", "start": 249.519, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "the same conviction that guides our", "start": 252.48, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "economy reforms through sound", "start": 253.92, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "macroeconomic management, stronger", "start": 256.239, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "institutions, private sector", "start": 258.799, "duration": 3.521}, {"text": "development, and strategic public", "start": 260.72, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "investment. We seek to give practical", "start": 262.32, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "meaning to our sustainable development", "start": 264.8, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "commitments.", "start": 266.96, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "This purpose binds our national", "start": 268.479, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "advancement to our continent's progress", "start": 270.96, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "and to our responsibility to contribute", "start": 273.199, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "to a peaceful, equitable and prosperous", "start": 275.28, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "world.", "start": 278.32, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "We understand that governments and", "start": 280.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "multilateral institutions earn trust", "start": 282.4, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "when their decisions improve lives. Yet", "start": 284.8, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "none of these gains will matter if we", "start": 287.68, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "turn a deep air to the trace gathering", "start": 290.08, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "around our borders and father appeal. We", "start": 292.56, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "inhabit the only planet known to sustain", "start": 295.84, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "human life. And as long as that", "start": 298.479, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "scientific park holds, we cannot pretend", "start": 300.72, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "that we are insulated from conflicts", "start": 303.52, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "elsewhere, geography or personal", "start": 305.52, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "exemption from the consequences of a", "start": 307.919, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "fractured wall. Mr. President, we reject", "start": 310.32, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "the Paul's choice between development", "start": 314.16, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "and climate action. Developing countries", "start": 315.759, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "must industrialize, eradicate poverty", "start": 319.039, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "and expand energy access through low", "start": 321.759, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "carbon c pathways supported by", "start": 323.6, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "technology transfer, capacity building", "start": 326.16, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "and climate finance. Africa contributes", "start": 328.56, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "less than 4% of the greenhouse gas", "start": 332.4, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "emissions yet be disproportionate", "start": 335.199, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "consequences. Nigeria remains committed", "start": 337.68, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "to the Paris agreement and an equitable", "start": 341.12, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "energy transition that reflects", "start": 343.68, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "historical responsibility and capacity", "start": 345.759, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "while protecting people's right to", "start": 348.96, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "development.", "start": 351.12, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Under our energy transition plan, we are", "start": 352.96, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "working towards net zero emissions by60", "start": 355.36, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "while expanding access to affordable,", "start": 358.72, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "reliable and sustainable energy. This", "start": 361.199, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "effort combines renewable energy, clean", "start": 363.919, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "cooking and gas as a transitional with", "start": 366.639, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "climate, smart agriculture and nature", "start": 369.84, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "based solutions. Finance must be", "start": 371.759, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "governed by equity and shared", "start": 374.96, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "responsibility rather than charity with", "start": 377.52, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "international commitments translated", "start": 380.4, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "into accessible, predictable and", "start": 382.16, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "adequately punded mechanism that enable", "start": 384.639, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "developing countries to pursue climate", "start": 387.28, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "action without compromising development", "start": 389.68, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "objectives.", "start": 392.319, "duration": 2.88}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 393.68, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "we refuse to surrender our technological", "start": 395.199, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "future to Paronaya. An invention can be", "start": 397.759, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "destructive or beneficial depending on", "start": 400.72, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "the purpose it serves and the judgment", "start": 403.12, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "of those who use it. A knife can take", "start": 405.44, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "life in the hands of an asalent and can", "start": 409.84, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "save one in the hands of a soldier. We", "start": 412.56, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "can deploy artificial intelligence to", "start": 415.84, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "wage war or use it to transform", "start": 417.52, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "healthare, education, agriculture,", "start": 419.759, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "governance and economic productivity.", "start": 423.44, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Much of the anxiety surrounding AI", "start": 426.24, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "reflect the distrust we have allowed to", "start": 428.8, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "grow amongst us. Nigeria is investing in", "start": 430.88, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "digital public infrastructure, broadband", "start": 434.639, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "connectivity, innovation systems,", "start": 437.199, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "research institutions and technology", "start": 440.0, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "entrepreneurship.", "start": 441.84, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "We invite the world to work with our", "start": 443.44, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "inventive, resourceful and enterprising", "start": 445.44, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "young people to direct AI towards", "start": 448.08, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "humanity's advancement rather than its", "start": 450.08, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "destruction. Mr. President, one of the", "start": 452.479, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "greatest obstacles to sustainable", "start": 455.68, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "development is inadequate financing.", "start": 457.36, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Many developing countries divorce", "start": 460.16, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "substantial resources to de servicing at", "start": 462.319, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "the expense of education, healthcare and", "start": 464.72, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "infrastructure. Nigeria has therefore", "start": 467.44, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "called for reform of the international", "start": 469.68, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "financial architecture, wider access to", "start": 471.28, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "concessional financing and depth", "start": 474.319, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "sustainability frameworks that recognize", "start": 476.56, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "developmental needs. We also support", "start": 478.96, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "innovative financing through private", "start": 481.44, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "capital, blended finance, south", "start": 483.599, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "cooperation and strategic partnerships", "start": 486.56, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "for sustainable development, climate", "start": 488.96, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "adaptation and resilient infrastructure.", "start": 491.12, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Nigeria further recognizes the African", "start": 494.56, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "continental free trade area as one of", "start": 497.12, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "the continent's most transformative", "start": 499.44, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "opportunities. It can strengthen", "start": 501.12, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "regional value chains, expand intra", "start": 504.08, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "African trade, promote industrialization", "start": 506.639, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "and attract investment. Africa must move", "start": 509.52, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "beyond its historical role as an", "start": 512.56, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "exporter of raw materials toward greater", "start": 514.8, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "value addition, manufacturing,", "start": 516.88, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "technological innovation and knowledge", "start": 519.36, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "driven growth. Our abundant natural", "start": 521.519, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "resources must become engines of shared", "start": 523.76, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "prosperity rather than sources of", "start": 526.32, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "perpetual dependency.", "start": 528.48, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Mr. President, no nation, however", "start": 530.64, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "formidable it defenses, can secure", "start": 534.56, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "itself completely against dangers", "start": 537.04, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "sustained beyond its borders. Terrorism,", "start": 539.2, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "organized crime, cyber attacks and", "start": 542.399, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "illicit finance exploit the gaps between", "start": 544.959, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "our national responses drawing strength", "start": 547.839, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "from the divisions that weaken", "start": 550.16, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "collective action. Nigeria's prolonged", "start": 551.6, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "struggle against booh haram is and other", "start": 554.32, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "armed groups has taught us that military", "start": 557.2, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "victories require enduring foundations", "start": 558.959, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "in education, economic opportunity,", "start": 561.36, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "accountable governance and communities", "start": 564.399, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "whose rights and dignity are protected.", "start": 566.8, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Development cannot take root where", "start": 570.16, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "violence repeatedly overro livelihoods", "start": 572.88, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "and peace cannot endure while injustice", "start": 575.6, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and exclusion replenish the ranks of", "start": 578.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "those who threaten it. Our common", "start": 581.04, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "security therefore demands cooperation", "start": 583.839, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "equal to the reach of the trade before", "start": 586.32, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "us. We must exchange intelligence,", "start": 588.399, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "strengthen institutional capacity,", "start": 592.399, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "interrupt the financing of violence, and", "start": 594.88, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "prevent weapons from crossing borders", "start": 596.8, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "that our responses too often fail to", "start": 599.04, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "cross. The turmoil in the Sahel", "start": 601.76, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "illustrates how insecurity in one", "start": 604.959, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "territory can imperil its neighbors,", "start": 607.44, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "displace populations, and prostate", "start": 610.399, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "commerce, regional integration, and", "start": 612.88, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "democratic governance. As a founding", "start": 615.04, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "member of ECOAS, Nigeria upholds", "start": 617.519, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "regional solidarity and African", "start": 620.079, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "leadership in resolving these challenges", "start": 621.839, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "reinforced by principal international", "start": 624.32, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "partnerships. No country can claim last", "start": 626.56, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "in safety while the forces capable of", "start": 630.0, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "disabilizing it retain sanctuary", "start": 631.92, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "resources and recruits elsewhere.", "start": 634.64, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Excellencies, Nigeria", "start": 637.519, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "remains committed to the peaceful", "start": 640.16, "duration": 3.28}, {"text": "settlement of disputes under the United", "start": 641.6, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Nations Charter. The conflicts in Sudan", "start": 643.44, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "and other war torn countries demand", "start": 646.32, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "urgent diplomacy to address their", "start": 648.32, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "humanitarian, economic and geopolitical", "start": 650.32, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "consequences. All parties must uphold", "start": 653.2, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "international humanitarian and human", "start": 655.92, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "rights law. Protect civilians and", "start": 658.079, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "facilitate humanitarian access,", "start": 661.2, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "negotiated settlements, must respect", "start": 663.68, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "sovereignty and territorial integrity", "start": 666.079, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "within and beyond our continent. No", "start": 668.8, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "claim to security can justify stabbing", "start": 671.36, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "children.", "start": 673.44, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "denying relief to civilians or erasing", "start": 674.56, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "communities from the land they call", "start": 677.2, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "home.", "start": 679.36, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "We should all be afraid of a wall in", "start": 680.959, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "which we can no longer tell the victim", "start": 682.959, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "from the aggressor. When our investment", "start": 684.72, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "in propaganda shields perpetrators from", "start": 687.839, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "justice to the point that telling the", "start": 690.24, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "truth becomes a crime, the promise of", "start": 692.32, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "this institution stands betrayed. We", "start": 695.519, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "place our faith in diplomacy because", "start": 698.079, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "military victories alone cannot secure", "start": 701.519, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "lasting peace. Dialogue, reconciliation", "start": 703.44, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "and inclusive political processes must", "start": 707.6, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "give people a stake in ending violence", "start": 710.32, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "and preserving the agreements that", "start": 712.64, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "follow. The United Nations must", "start": 714.32, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "therefore strengthen peacekeeping and", "start": 716.959, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "give greater attention to peace", "start": 719.839, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "building, mediation, institution", "start": 721.279, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "building and sustainable development.", "start": 723.839, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "Prevention", "start": 726.639, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "must command greater resources and", "start": 728.16, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "political attention. Mr. President,", "start": 730.88, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Africa is ready for the future. Our", "start": 734.16, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "resilience, our ingenuity, our useful", "start": 736.8, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "population, our natural wealth and our", "start": 739.68, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "expanding markets can make us a major", "start": 742.0, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "driver of global growth in this century.", "start": 743.839, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "The African continental pre trade area", "start": 746.32, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "offers exceptional scope to deepen", "start": 749.6, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "regional integration, accelerate", "start": 751.76, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "industrialization and strengthen our", "start": 753.76, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "place in global value chains. Developing", "start": 756.0, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "countries must recognize as", "start": 758.88, "duration": 3.519}, {"text": "indispensable partners whose", "start": 760.399, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "contributions to global solutions and", "start": 762.399, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "shared prosperity extend far beyond", "start": 764.399, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "their need for assistance. Such a", "start": 767.12, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "partnership requires a united nations", "start": 769.6, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "that evolves with the aspirations of the", "start": 771.92, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "present and future generations.", "start": 774.0, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "Institutions that adapt preserve their", "start": 776.399, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "relevance. Those that resist change", "start": 779.279, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "imperil. Nigeria remains optimistic", "start": 782.72, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "because history shows that countries", "start": 785.839, "duration": 3.201}, {"text": "acting with common purpose and", "start": 787.519, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "determination can overcome obstacles", "start": 789.04, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "once considered insomnable. Our", "start": 792.079, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "generation has the privilege of shaping", "start": 794.639, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "the future and the responsibility to", "start": 797.12, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "answer for it. Those who follow us will", "start": 799.2, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "judge our courage in reforming outdated", "start": 802.8, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "institutions, building cooperation", "start": 805.6, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "across divisions, protecting the planet,", "start": 807.92, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "and directing technology responsibly.", "start": 810.959, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Mr. President, excellencies,", "start": 814.079, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "distinguished delegates, Nigeria pledges", "start": 816.56, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "cooperation over confrontation, dialogue", "start": 818.959, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "over division, hope over fear, and", "start": 822.32, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "partnership over isolation. These", "start": 825.6, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "choices must shape institutions that", "start": 828.56, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "respond to the legitimate aspirations of", "start": 830.639, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "all nations. Restoring trust requires us", "start": 832.56, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "to honor our obligations to one another", "start": 836.16, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "and to manage the changes before us with", "start": 838.639, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "justice, wisdom, and compassion.", "start": 841.04, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "The world looks to this assembly for", "start": 845.279, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "leadership and our debates most lead to", "start": 847.76, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "action worthy of that expectation.", "start": 851.04, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "Nigeria believes that the humanity we", "start": 853.519, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "share is stronger than the divisions we", "start": 855.839, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "have met and that cooperation remains", "start": 858.32, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "wiser than complete. A reformed", "start": 861.6, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "inclusive and effective United Nations", "start": 865.279, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "is indispensable to the peaceful, just", "start": 868.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "and sustainable world that future", "start": 871.279, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "generations deserve. Whatever our", "start": 873.68, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "differences, I repeat, whatever our", "start": 876.16, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "differences, we must remember that", "start": 878.8, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "humanity is our oldest citizenship and", "start": 882.399, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "peace is inheritance we owe every child.", "start": 886.16, "duration": 8.52}, {"text": "I thank you for your kind attention.", "start": 890.399, "duration": 4.281}, {"text": "Hello.", "start": 901.68, "duration": 2.56}, {"text": ">> On behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 902.48, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "thank the vice president of the Federal", "start": 904.24, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Republic of Nigeria.", "start": 906.48, "duration": 2.96}]